# DESIGN.md visual rules

Read `DESIGN.md` at the repo root before generating or restyling any UI.

- Use only the documented color, type, radius, and spacing tokens.
- Accent is teal `#3dd6c6`; secondary telemetry is `#4db5ff`. Never purple AI gradients.
- Display type: Instrument Serif. Body: DM Sans. Mono: JetBrains Mono. Telugu: Noto Sans Telugu.
- One primary CTA per viewport. Hierarchy through spacing and weight before color.
- Marketing may use a cinematic scroll layer; consoles stay denser and operational.
